From ae60b38c788dcbe345e0c2149ef1e18ec1794d98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Season Tempo Build <claude@seasontempo.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:56:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Error boundaries, Files on mobile, and readiness

Error handling
  A failure inside the product showed the framework's own error screen. There
  is now a branded boundary with Try again and Return home, a global boundary
  for root-layout failures, and a not-found page. No stack trace, message or
  database detail reaches a coach; the digest is shown and the full error still
  goes to the server log.

Files
  Five table columns squeezed onto a phone put Size and Uploaded off the right
  edge with nothing to suggest they existed. Desktop keeps its table; mobile
  gets a card list built from the same rows. Tabs scroll themselves instead of
  widening the page.

Readiness
  Uniform removed from Needs Action entirely, with nothing in its place.
